# Packaging ignore list for `moonbitlang/openseek`.
#
# `.moonignore` overrides `.gitignore` in this directory, so the build,
# dependency and local-state entries from `.gitignore` are repeated here. The
# rest excludes what does not belong in the published archive: nested member
# modules (each is published separately or not published to mooncakes at all)
# and developer-only tooling, docs and tests.

_build/
.mooncakes/
node_modules/
target/

# Local state and editor/OS cruft, repeated from `.gitignore`. `.openseek/` holds
# dogfooding session state (prompts, source, tool output) and must never enter a
# published archive; `.moonagent/`, `.repos/` and `.claude/` are the same kind of
# untracked local state, and `.proton/` is a generated runtime manifest.
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.moonagent/
.repos/
.openseek/
.claude/
.proton/

# Nested workspace-member modules and apps, published separately.
/desktop
/editor
/protocol
/tools_sdk
/cmd/viz_app
/inspect
/scripts

# Developer tooling, docs and tests that do not ship in the published module.
/tests
/justfile
/AGENTS.md
/agent-improvement-guide.md
/improvement.md
/shrink_package.md
/desktop-dev.html
/docs/plans
/moon.work
